Spec: Technical Debt Register

Purpose:
  Track unresolved bridge correctness, workflow, portability, and maintainability risks without retaining completed work as active debt.

Owns:
  ./TECH-DEBT.md

References:
  ../speckit-specdd.sdd
  ./spec.sdd
  ./TODO.md

Must:
  The register contains unresolved risks only.
  Correctness risks distinguish deterministic authority guarantees from agentic semantic verification gaps.
  Entries identify the observable risk and preferred direction without duplicating detailed implementation plans from ./TODO.md.
  Completed risks are removed once current code, tests, and documentation establish the intended behavior.

Done when:
  Maintainers can distinguish unresolved correctness risks from completed bridge hardening and select future work without reconstructing historical TODO state.
